sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Content User
  participant Portal as Web Portal
  participant CMA as Content Management Application
  participant Media as Media Storage
  participant EventBus as Event Bus
  participant Analyser as File Analyser Service
  participant Thumb as Thumbnail Service
  participant Transcoder as Video Transcoding Service
  actor Approver as Content Approver
  participant Publisher as Playlist Publisher
  participant Playlist as Playlist Service
  participant Player as Digital Signage Player
  participant Analytics as Analytics Service
  participant AnalyticsDB as Analytics Database

  User->>Portal: Upload batch and assign attributes
  Portal->>CMA: Submit upload command
  CMA->>Media: Store uploaded media
  CMA->>EventBus: Append/publish ContentBatchUploaded
  CMA->>CMA: Update content read model

  EventBus->>Analyser: Request media analysis
  Analyser->>Media: Read uploaded media
  Analyser->>EventBus: Publish MediaFileAnalysed

  par Thumbnail generation
    Analyser->>Thumb: Route video for thumbnail generation
    Thumb->>Media: Write generated thumbnail
    Thumb->>EventBus: Publish ThumbnailGenerated
  and Video transcoding
    Analyser->>Transcoder: Route video for transcoding
    Transcoder->>Media: Write transcoded video renditions
    Transcoder->>EventBus: Publish VideoTranscoded
  end

  Approver->>Portal: Approve content
  Portal->>CMA: Submit approval decision
  CMA->>EventBus: Append/publish ContentApproved
  EventBus->>Publisher: Notify approved content is ready

  Publisher->>CMA: Read content attributes and projections
  Publisher->>Playlist: Publish new playlist version
  Publisher->>EventBus: Publish PlaylistUpdated

  Player->>Playlist: Poll for new playlist version
  Playlist-->>Player: Return playlist version
  Player->>Media: Download playlist media assets
  Player->>Analytics: Send ContentPlayed event
  Analytics->>AnalyticsDB: Persist playback count
  Analytics->>EventBus: Optionally append playback event
